WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.377
"I have some news," said Mr. Grill.

2
00:00:18.378 --> 00:00:21.559
"I'm forming a racing team."

3
00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:24.013
"What?" cried Eddy.

4
00:00:24.014 --> 00:00:26.802
"Really?" said Zippy.

5
00:00:26.803 --> 00:00:32.043
"Tryouts are next week," said Mr. Grill.

6
00:00:32.044 --> 00:00:36.376
"I'll pick the fastest cars.

7
00:00:36.377 --> 00:00:39.218
They'll get team stickers."

8
00:00:39.219 --> 00:00:43.033
"Oh boy!" said Eddy.

9
00:00:43.034 --> 00:00:54.243
"I hope I make the team."

10
00:00:54.244 --> 00:00:57.525
"You will," said Poppy.

11
00:00:57.526 --> 00:01:01.681
"You're fast," said Jeb.

12
00:01:01.682 --> 00:01:12.709
"We'll help you train," said Dipper.

13
00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:32.262
Eddy trained all week.

14
00:01:32.263 --> 00:01:39.520
He drove faster each day.

15
00:01:39.521 --> 00:01:47.177
His friends cheered him on.

16
00:01:47.178 --> 00:01:55.672
"Go, Eddy!" said Jeb.

17
00:01:55.673 --> 00:01:58.845
Zippy flew by Eddy.

18
00:01:58.846 --> 00:02:02.169
"Ha-ha!" said Zippy.

19
00:02:02.170 --> 00:02:25.398
"Eddy won't make the team!"

20
00:02:25.399 --> 00:02:28.785
Eddy stopped.

21
00:02:28.786 --> 00:02:32.346
"Don't listen to Zippy," said Poppy.

22
00:02:32.347 --> 00:02:34.802
"You'll make the team."

23
00:02:34.803 --> 00:02:38.285
Eddy sighed.

24
00:02:38.286 --> 00:02:43.405
"I hope you're right."

